guide polestar-completionist-alliance/attune-aqual
title Aqual Quintessence (Molten Core item) (Completionist)
faction Alliance
levels 56-60
category Dungeons
zone Searing Gorge
pitch Aqual Quintessence: Douses the Molten Core's runes; Majordomo Executus comes out only when every rune is doused. Duke Hydraxis hands it out once Hands of the Enemy is done.
why Douses the Molten Core's runes; Majordomo Executus comes out only when every rune is doused. Duke Hydraxis hands it out once Hands of the Enemy is done.




